      "extract": "COHOMOLOGY RINGS OF CHARACTER VARIETIES ANTON MELLIT Abstract. In this talk I give an introduction and present some recent progress towards understanding the cohomology rings of character varieties of Riemann surfaces, such as the proof of the P = W conjecture and the computation of the zero-dimensional COHA. In the case of punctured sphere I present an explicit description relating the cohomology rings to the",
